{"id":"wb-7-1026","name":"兰亭","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"兰亭","text":"兰亭古迹是位于中华人民共和国浙江绍兴的一个文化古迹和旅游胜地，位于绍兴城区西南13公里的兰渚山麓，是东晋著名书法家、会稽内史王羲之的园林住所，是一座晋代园林。东晋永和九年（353年）三月初三，王羲之与谢安、王献之等40多位名士在此举办修禊集会，王羲之“微醉之中，振笔直遂”，写下了著名的“天下第一行书”《兰亭集序》。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E5%85%B0%E4%BA%AD","revisionId":93301726,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=93301726","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与地理坐标一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/9f40fd2ac2639678d621381e.jpg","title":"20240130_Lanting.jpg","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:20240130_Lanting.jpg","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/4/42/20240130_Lanting.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"Yumeto","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0","caption":"Lanting","width":320,"height":240}}